  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "1.9.2 — Adds configuration switches EIAMSecurity:EnableSecurityMiddleware and EIAMSecurity:EnableAuthorizationMiddleware. Both default to true, so existing hosts are unaffected. When a switch is false the middleware is not added to the pipeline at all. Read once at startup; restart to apply. 1.9.1 — Targets .NET 10. Removes configuration values that were previously embedded in the shipped assembly; host applications must now supply JwtSettings:Key and CypherSecurity:IntegrationPermission through their own configuration. Trims unused package dependencies from 58 to 5.",
